      "title": "Check Denominator Continuity",
      "mathExpression": "\\lim_{(x, y) \\to (1, 2)} (x + y) = 1 + 2 = 3 \\ne 0",
      "explanation": "The denominator does not vanish at (1, 2), so the rational function is continuous at this point.",
